{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Hey Jon! Long time no talk! A lot's happened - I just got accepted for a fashion internship!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-c3988ffdd454ca035af90b45", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.268949+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c3988ffdd454ca035af90b45", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c3988ffdd454ca035af90b45", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Congrats, Gina! That's awesome news about the fashion internship. \ud83c\udf89 So stoked for you. Where is the internship and how're you feelin' about it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-95b83590a24e3a558659d877", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.296830+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "95b83590a24e3a558659d877", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "95b83590a24e3a558659d877", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks! I'm excited and kinda nervous. Gonna be a big change. It's part-time position in the fashion department of an international company."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-f87ad7c064fe6e99aac58683", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.316048+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f87ad7c064fe6e99aac58683", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f87ad7c064fe6e99aac58683", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Way to go, Gina! You really stepped up. What's your plan for the future?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-d380551d1d5e7caf04b2f99d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.343847+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d380551d1d5e7caf04b2f99d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d380551d1d5e7caf04b2f99d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks! I'm a mix of excited and scared to get into fashion, but I'm trying to stay upbeat and learn as much as I can. What about you? Got something new?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-40649116f98c36cc33771938", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.371346+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "40649116f98c36cc33771938", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "40649116f98c36cc33771938", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: I'm currently reading \"The Lean Startup\" and hoping it'll give me tips for my biz."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-221013a8759fd7bcff711641", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.398299+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "221013a8759fd7bcff711641", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "221013a8759fd7bcff711641", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: It sounds great! Could it spark any ideas for your dance studio?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-6f947f191081d5a39b298274", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.410657+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6f947f191081d5a39b298274", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6f947f191081d5a39b298274", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Yeah, the book got me thinking about building a focused and efficient business. Adapting and tweaking from customer feedback is important too, so I'm gonna try it out!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-f6fd0c6580e01a5013eb6368", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.442970+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f6fd0c6580e01a5013eb6368", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f6fd0c6580e01a5013eb6368", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Woah, Jon, that whiteboard's got a bunch of good ideas! How you gonna keep track and stay on schedule with those dates?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-c00b49c3c744e95b366b241a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.460175+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c00b49c3c744e95b366b241a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c00b49c3c744e95b366b241a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina! It helps me keep track of ideas and milestones. Gives me a visual of my progress and keeps me organized."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-af7ca603601f0cc783145cda", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.478783+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "af7ca603601f0cc783145cda", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "af7ca603601f0cc783145cda", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Nice idea! Having something visual can help with organizing and motivation. What're you working on currently?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-e8374147ed99a91d19833e44", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.496147+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e8374147ed99a91d19833e44", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e8374147ed99a91d19833e44", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: I'm wrapping up the business plan and looking for investors. My passion for the project and belief in its success are driving me."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-ce32e3b1abb9f9edcb3c7708", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.524179+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ce32e3b1abb9f9edcb3c7708", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ce32e3b1abb9f9edcb3c7708", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Wow, Jon! Impressed by your commitment. How's the hunt for investors going?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-a67e67b72f933dc5472b6bae", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.548247+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a67e67b72f933dc5472b6bae", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a67e67b72f933dc5472b6bae", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Searching for investors has been tough, but I'm staying hopeful. It's all a process and I'm learning a ton."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-9461117f6f94dd5be395a294", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.571249+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9461117f6f94dd5be395a294", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9461117f6f94dd5be395a294", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Yeah Jon, you've got the right attitude! Keep learning and growing through it all. Keep going!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-15e0ba36e6b56c7f9c20f6c5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.592774+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "15e0ba36e6b56c7f9c20f6c5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "15e0ba36e6b56c7f9c20f6c5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! I really appreciate your help. I'm gonna keep on going and never quit."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-aaff20524178f1cf61daafe6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.609842+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aaff20524178f1cf61daafe6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aaff20524178f1cf61daafe6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-ea3a8ffcd6493abcd0175edb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.635033+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ea3a8ffcd6493abcd0175edb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ea3a8ffcd6493abcd0175edb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Your words really mean a lot. Don't worry, I won't let anything get me down."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-18a08d2baac05e1e03592632", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.656287+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "18a08d2baac05e1e03592632", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "18a08d2baac05e1e03592632", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Go Jon! Obstacles are inevitable, but you can do awesome things. Keep going!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_12-b14717abd04803bcad11c41a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:30.673793+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b14717abd04803bcad11c41a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b14717abd04803bcad11c41a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
